Package: nwg-look
Version: @DEB_NWG-LOOK_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/nwg-piotr/nwg-look
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, gsettings-desktop-schemas, dconf
Description: GTK settings editor for Wayland desktops
 nwg-look edits GTK theme, icon, cursor and font settings. This control skeleton
 is staged with the blocker recipe; the package is not buildable until the repo
 has a Go+cgo iPhoneOS cross-build path for gotk3 and a decision on xcur2png.
